==Description==
'''Pumpkin''' was a form of non-spendable season currency that could have been earned during the [[Lunar Overture Event]] on any map and gamemode. It was obtained by killing enemies with pumpkin hats. Any naturally spawned enemy could spawn with these pumpkin hats and it would drop from one to three '''Pumpkins'''. 

It was used to complete Ranks on the [[Lunar Overture Event#Lunar Overture Season Pass|Lunar Overture Season Pass]].

On its icon, it takes the appearance of the {{RLinkC|17450053|Sinister P.}} accessory, while on its pick-up it is the {{RLinkC|16437015|Happy Jack-o'-Lantern}}.

